SUMMARY:Lego Challenge: Elmvale and Midhurst Branches
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to build\, design and imagine during the library Lego 
 Challenge where each week features a new theme to inspire inventive 
 creations and exciting ideas. Kids will use their problem solving skills 
 and imagination.\n\nMondays 10:30am at Elmvale and Midhurst 
 Branches\n\nCost: Free\n\nNo registration required for this drop-in 
 program.
LOCATION:Elmvale and Midhurst Branch 
ORGANIZER;CN="Springwater Library":MAILTO:springwaterlibrary@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Childrens Programming
UID:LibCal-8312-4024558
URL:https://springwater-ca.libcal.com/event/4024558
END:VEVENT
