SUMMARY:You're "Otter"ly Amazing! Elmvale Branch (NOW FULL)
DESCRIPTION:This program is NOW FULL but we have a second session at 5:30pm 
 available for sign up\n\nSnuggle up for a paws-itively adorable program at 
 the library filled with otter-themed crafts and games that are sure to make 
 a splash. Kids will enjoy silly\, fun sweet stories and hands-on adventures 
 inspired by everyone's favourite furry little swimmers.\n\nTuesday August 
 18\, 10:30am at Elmvale Branch \n\nCost: Free\n\nRegistration required.
LOCATION:The McGuire Meeting Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Springwater Library":MAILTO:springwaterlibrary@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Childrens Programming
UID:LibCal-8312-4024546
URL:https://springwater-ca.libcal.com/event/4024546
