SUMMARY:Knit and Crochet Kids
DESCRIPTION:Junior knitters and crochet enthusiasts are welcome to come 
 create and be proud at this drop in program at the library. Parent 
 supervision is required.\n\nLearn from your peers (there is also a 30 
 minute overlap with the adult Knit and Crochet group for extra 
 help).\n\nBring your own materials.\n\nThursdays 5:30pm-7pm at Elmvale 
 Branch.\n\nCost: Free\n\nNo registration required.
LOCATION:Elmvale Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Springwater Library":MAILTO:springwaterlibrary@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Childrens Programming
