BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260901T140000Z
DTEND:20260925T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T000000Z
SUMMARY:Family Boo-k Boxes All Branches
DESCRIPTION:Sign up and receive a Family Book Box filled with crafts and 
 cool freebies! This month's Family Book Boxes have the theme of Halloween 
 and include a witch wreath craft.\n\nEach box will contain:\n\n\n	Two 
 picture books (please return these books to the library as they are part of 
 our collection)\n	A craft to make together\n	Surprise stack of free items 
 that may include stickers\, treats and more!\n\n\nThis program will run 
 bi-monthly at all three branch locations in October\, December\, February\, 
 April and June.\n\nBoxes can be picked up the 1st of the month (Thursday 
 October 1)\n\nCost: Free\n\nRegistration required.
LOCATION:All Branches
ORGANIZER;CN="Springwater Library":MAILTO:springwaterlibrary@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Family Program
UID:LibCal-8312-4056050
URL:https://springwater-ca.libcal.com/event/4056050
END:VEVENT
