SUMMARY:After School Open Play Minesing Branch
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday in the Minesing Community Hall\, come on in for 
 our open play session. Games\, toys\, LEGO\, and colouring are all 
 available to use with friends and family. The library will provide the 
 games and toys or you can bring your own! All ages are welcome to join the 
 fun!\n\nThursdays 3:30pm-5:30pm at Minesing Branch\n\nCost: Free\n\nNo 
 registration required for this drop-in program.
LOCATION:Minesing Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Springwater Library":MAILTO:springwaterlibrary@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Childrens Programming
